# Technical Architecture

## Backend Stack
- Spring Boot - Core framework
- Spring MVC - Web framework
- Mybatis-Plus - ORM framework
- Spring Security - Security framework
- JWT - Authentication
- Redis List - Async messaging (replaces RocketMQ broker)
- Redis - Caching
- MySQL - Primary database
- Spring `@Scheduled` - Task scheduling (in manager-api)

## Search
- MySQL candidate set + in-memory filter (`GoodsSearchServiceImpl`)
- No Elasticsearch dependency

## Frontend Stack
### Admin & Seller Portals (lilishop-ui)
- Vue.js - Frontend framework
- iView / Element - UI components
- Vuex - State management
- Vue Router - Routing
- Axios - HTTP client

### Mobile Applications (lilishop-uniapp)
- Uni-app - Cross-platform framework
- uViewui - UI components
- SCSS - Styling

## Infrastructure
- Nginx - Load balancing & reverse proxy
- Aliyun OSS - Object storage
- Docker - Containerization
- Docker Compose - Container orchestration
